            { q: "What is training data poisoning?", opts: ["Corrupting a database", "Injecting malicious data into an AI model's training set to influence its behavior", "A type of SQL injection", "Corrupting model weights after training"], a: 1, exp: "Data poisoning affects model behavior. Poisoned training data can cause models to have backdoors, make incorrect predictions, or behave maliciously." }
